  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b3d12e65-a883-449b-b135-16d029987d27",
    "name": "Cuboh Integration Locations Menu API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Partner-gated integration API for Cuboh, a restaurant online-ordering management platform. This document consolidates the publicly documented surface of Cuboh's Direct API (v2.0) and Connect API (v0.1) covering orders, menus, merchant locations, and webhooks.\n\nAccess is not self-serve. Cuboh provisions an integration token to approved technology partners during onboarding and QA certification (contact integrations@cuboh.com). Requests authenticate with an Authorization header in the form `Token <your token>`; tokens are unique per partner and a single token works across all endpoints. Cuboh delivers events to partner-hosted webhook URLs, signed with an X-Cuboh-Signature HMAC-SHA256 header.\n\nEndpoint paths, methods, base URL, and the authentication scheme below are transcribed from Cuboh's published OpenAPI documents at https://docs.cuboh.com/direct and https://docs.cuboh.com/connect. Request and response schemas are not reproduced here; consult the Cuboh documentation for full payload definitions.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Cuboh Integrations\n Email: integrations@cuboh.com",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
  }
}